{"title": "Elena Rybakina becomes world No. 1, reaches US Open semi-finals", "summary": "Elena Rybakina has secured the world No. 1 ranking in women's tennis, which will be official when rankings update on Monday. She reached the US Open semi-finals after defeating Qinwen Zheng. Her ascent to the top spot marks a significant moment for Kazakhstan in global sports.", "summary_points": ["Elena Rybakina will become the world No. 1 ranked female tennis player on Monday.", "She reached the US Open semi-finals by defeating Qinwen Zheng.", "Her rise to No. 1 is considered a historic achievement for Kazakhstan."], "title_hi": "एलेना रायबकिना विश्व की नंबर 1 बनीं, यूएस ओपन सेमीफाइनल में पहुंचीं", "summary_hi": "एलेना रायबकिना महिला टेनिस में विश्व की नंबर 1 रैंकिंग हासिल करने वाली हैं, जो सोमवार को रैंकिंग अपडेट होने पर आधिकारिक हो जाएगी। उन्होंने किनवेन झेंग को हराकर यूएस ओपन सेमीफाइनल में जगह बनाई। शीर्ष स्थान पर उनका उदय कजाकिस्तान के लिए वैश्विक खेल में एक महत्वपूर्ण क्षण है।", "summary_points_hi": ["एलेना रायबकिना सोमवार को विश्व की नंबर 1 महिला टेनिस खिलाड़ी बन जाएंगी।", "उन्होंने किनवेन झेंग को हराकर यूएस ओपन सेमीफाइनल में जगह बनाई।", "नंबर 1 पर उनका उदय कजाकिस्तान के लिए एक ऐतिहासिक उपलब्धि मानी जाती है।"], "framing": {"left": ["The sole rated outlet in this tier led with Elena Rybakina dethroning Aryna Sabalenka to win her first U.S. Open title and become No. 1."], "center": ["Emphasized Rybakina's rise to world No. 1 and her historic achievement for Kazakhstan.", "Highlighted her victory over Qinwen Zheng en route to the US Open semi-finals."], "right": ["Focused on the Zverev vs. Shelton US Open Final with a preview of serve, return, and break points."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["इस श्रेणी में एकमात्र रेटेड आउटलेट ने एलेना रयाबकिना के आर्यना सबालेंका को हराकर अपना पहला यूएस ओपन खिताब जीतने और नंबर 1 बनने पर प्रकाश डाला।"], "center": ["रायबकिना के विश्व नंबर 1 बनने और कजाकिस्तान के लिए उनकी ऐतिहासिक उपलब्धि पर जोर दिया गया।", "यूएस ओपन सेमीफाइनल की राह में किनवेन झेंग पर उनकी जीत को उजागर किया गया।"], "right": ["सर्वे, रिटर्न और ब्रेक पॉइंट के पूर्वावलोकन के साथ ज्वेरेव बनाम शेल्टन यूएस ओपन फाइनल पर ध्यान केंद्रित किया गया।"]}, "topic": "Sports", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://www.japantimes.co.jp/japantimes/uploads/images/2026/09/10/562362.JPG", "sources": [{"source": "The Japan Times", "owner": "The Japan Times", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.japantimes.co.jp/sports/2026/09/10/tennis/rybakina-secures-rise-top-ranking", "headline": "Elena Rybakina secures rise to No. 1 to make history for Kazakhstan"}, {"source": "Irish Independent", "owner": "Irish Independent", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5", "headline": "Elena Rybakina claims world number one spot with win over Qinwen Zheng to reach US Open semi-finals"}, {"source": "Irish Independent", "owner": "Irish Independent", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5", "headline": "Elena Rybakina set to become world No 1 as US Open semi-finals includes all top-four female seeds"}, {"source": "The Statesman", "owner": "The Statesman", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "WTA Rankings: Rybakina officially crowned World No. 1 after maiden US Open triumph, Zheng makes huge jump"}, {"source": "Times Now", "owner": "Times Now", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Zverev Vs Shelton US Open Final: Serve, Return, Break Points - Who Holds The Edge?"}, {"source": "The New York Times", "owner": "The New York Times", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQWDFSekFIQ204TzZyUnFxX1A1Nmw3UWNWYV9Iem5qTXU1M3ZhVGJ0Z0lwQkdJaS1RN1FRU0E5ZnZDRm9aX3hBckdIVUhPY3lWbHRMMk9sU0lDdVRKOC1TenBOUXlDQklHMG1KVnVrSTFkWEFud3RtYndGNnktOU5OdVljeXhRc1ozdkpjRmh4b3RGbVVSQS1JcFdHMG5PVFdFc1RnT0VaSlNSempYRHoyMll